# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the CI job "ThreadSanitizer (audio)". Only for libraries that are
# not built with -fsanitize=thread, never for QiYaa's own code.
#
# Qt hands work between its own threads (the network thread, posted events) with synchronisation
# compiled into its libraries, which TSan does not see; it then reports the allocations, frees and
# eventfd writes made on either side. These entries ignore what those libraries do themselves; every
# access from QiYaa's code is still checked.
called_from_lib:libglib-2.0.so
called_from_lib:libQt6Core.so
called_from_lib:libQt6Network.so
